      "message": "feat: enable creator-delete pipeline in production (#148)\n\n* feat: enable creator-delete pipeline in production\n\nFlip CREATOR_DELETE_PIPELINE_ENABLED from false to true. Prerequisites\nverified: D1 creator_deletions table exists with physical_deleted_at\ncolumn (migrations 006+007), DELETE is in validActions (PR #147).\n\nBlossom ENABLE_PHYSICAL_DELETE remains false, so all deletes are\nsoft-delete only.\n\n* fix: validate delete author ownership and handle transient relay failures\n\nAddresses dcadenas review on PR #148:\n\n- Verify kind-5 author matches target event author before calling\n  Blossom DELETE (prevents cross-creator deletion)\n- Distinguish transient relay failures (5xx, 429, network) from\n  confirmed not-found (404) in fetchNostrEventById via opt-in\n  throwOnTransient option\n- Transient target fetch failures are retryable; promote to permanent\n  after MAX_RETRY_COUNT (5)",
